  "captions": [
    {
      "block": "01",
      "text": "In a block office in Rampur, a dashboard turns red:",
      "start": 0.3,
      "end": 3.736
    },
    {
      "block": "01",
      "text": "Class 3 subtraction has fallen eighteen points.",
      "start": 3.776,
      "end": 7.138
    },
    {
      "block": "01",
      "text": "And then…",
      "start": 7.178,
      "end": 7.945
    },
    {
      "block": "01",
      "text": "nothing happens.",
      "start": 7.985,
      "end": 9.203
    },
    {
      "block": "01",
      "text": "Officers have data, but every system stops at the alert.",
      "start": 9.243,
      "end": 13.159
    },
    {
      "block": "01",
      "text": "No owner, no deadline, no proof,",
      "start": 13.199,
      "end": 15.951
    },
    {
      "block": "01",
      "text": "and no one checks whether children learned more.",
      "start": 15.991,
      "end": 18.822
    },
    {
      "block": "02",
      "text": "Karyavahi turns every learning drop into a case:",
      "start": 20.3,
      "end": 23.156
    },
    {
      "block": "02",
      "text": "flag, diagnose, plan, approve, act, verify.",
      "start": 23.196,
      "end": 27.325
    },
    {
      "block": "02",
      "text": "And a case closes only when the next assessment shows",
      "start": 27.365,
      "end": 30.294
    },
    {
      "block": "02",
      "text": "children learned more.",
      "start": 30.334,
      "end": 31.642
    },
    {
      "block": "03",
      "text": "The block officer starts on a command centre,",
      "start": 32.3,
      "end": 35.252
    },
    {
      "block": "03",
      "text": "not a spreadsheet:",
      "start": 35.292,
      "end": 36.949
    },
    {
      "block": "03",
      "text": "their own area on a real map, and what needs them today.",
      "start": 36.999,
      "end": 41.081
    },
    {
      "block": "03",
      "text": "Anything is one search away, or they can just ask Claude.",
      "start": 41.131,
      "end": 45.156
    },
    {
      "block": "03",
      "text": "Here is the case:",
      "start": 45.206,
      "end": 46.66
    },
    {
      "block": "03",
      "text": "the drop, the schools driving it,",
      "start": 46.71,
      "end": 49.044
    },
    {
      "block": "03",
      "text": "and the conditions behind it.",
      "start": 49.084,
      "end": 51.148
    },
    {
      "block": "03",
      "text": "Claude explains it in plain words,",
      "start": 51.198,
      "end": 53.534
    },
    {
      "block": "03",
      "text": "and every figure it writes is checked against the records.",
      "start": 53.574,
      "end": 57.322
    },
    {
      "block": "03",
      "text": "It suggests a plan from an evidence library, with real costs.",
      "start": 57.372,
      "end": 62.018
    },
    {
      "block": "03",
      "text": "But the officer decides, and a second officer approves,",
      "start": 62.068,
      "end": 65.892
    },
    {
      "block": "03",
      "text": "in one tap.",
      "start": 65.932,
      "end": 67.249
    },
    {
      "block": "03",
      "text": "Every task gets an owner and a deadline.",
      "start": 67.299,
      "end": 70.755
    },
    {
      "block": "04",
      "text": "For headmasters and field staff,",
      "start": 75.3,
      "end": 77.669
    },
    {
      "block": "04",
      "text": "it works the way they already work.",
      "start": 77.709,
      "end": 80.083
    },
    {
      "block": "04",
      "text": "It opens in Hindi.",
      "start": 80.133,
      "end": 81.834
    },
    {
      "block": "04",
      "text": "They can listen to their day instead of reading it,",
      "start": 81.884,
      "end": 85.204
    },
    {
      "block": "04",
      "text": "and speak a note instead of typing.",
      "start": 85.244,
      "end": 88.175
    },
    {
      "block": "04",
      "text": "No signal?",
      "start": 88.225,
      "end": 89.475
    },
    {
      "block": "04",
      "text": "Proof is saved on the phone,",
      "start": 89.525,
      "end": 91.446
    },
    {
      "block": "04",
      "text": "and sent when the network returns, with the location checked.",
      "start": 91.486,
      "end": 95.568
    },
    {
      "block": "04",
      "text": "And they don't even need the app:",
      "start": 95.618,
      "end": 97.985
    },
    {
      "block": "04",
      "text": "on WhatsApp, tasks arrive, a reply marks them done,",
      "start": 98.035,
      "end": 101.967
    },
    {
      "block": "04",
      "text": "and a photo becomes proof.",
      "start": 102.007,
      "end": 104.165
    },
    {
      "block": "05",
      "text": "Proof is checked by someone other than the person who did the work.",
      "start": 110.3,
      "end": 114.395
    },
    {
      "block": "05",
      "text": "When the next round arrives,",
      "start": 114.445,
      "end": 116.399
    },
    {
      "block": "05",
      "text": "Karyavahi compares plan schools with similar schools,",
      "start": 116.439,
      "end": 119.714
    },
    {
      "block": "05",
      "text": "and asks:",
      "start": 119.754,
      "end": 121.03
    },
    {
      "block": "05",
      "text": "did it work?",
      "start": 121.08,
      "end": 122.363
    },
    {
      "block": "05",
      "text": "If not, the case reopens.",
      "start": 122.413,
      "end": 124.854
    },
    {
      "block": "05",
      "text": "And the Action Taken Report writes itself.",
      "start": 124.904,
      "end": 128.416
    },
    {
      "block": "06",
      "text": "Claude only drafts and explains,",
      "start": 130.3,
      "end": 132.775
    },
    {
      "block": "06",
      "text": "from records the user is allowed to see, always cited.",
      "start": 132.815,
      "end": 136.998
    },
    {
      "block": "06",
      "text": "The decisions are made by people,",
      "start": 137.048,
      "end": 139.234
    },
    {
      "block": "06",
      "text": "and every change goes into a tamper-evident audit trail.",
      "start": 139.274,
      "end": 143.116
    },
    {
      "block": "06",
      "text": "Schools, costs and district figures come from real public data.",
      "start": 143.166,
      "end": 147.862
    },
    {
      "block": "06",
      "text": "And it's tested end to end:",
      "start": 147.912,
      "end": 150.046
    },
    {
      "block": "06",
      "text": "every page, every role.",
      "start": 150.096,
      "end": 152.283
    },
    {
      "block": "07",
      "text": "Next:",
      "start": 155.3,
      "end": 156.293
    },
    {
      "block": "07",
      "text": "a pilot in one district, with the state's own data,",
      "start": 156.343,
      "end": 159.896
    },
    {
      "block": "07",
      "text": "then state-wide.",
      "start": 159.936,
      "end": 161.44
    },
    {
      "block": "07",
      "text": "Karyavahi.",
      "start": 161.49,
      "end": 162.714
    },
    {
      "block": "07",
      "text": "AI drafts.",
      "start": 162.764,
      "end": 164.245
    },
    {
      "block": "07",
      "text": "Officers decide.",
      "start": 164.295,
      "end": 165.826
    },
    {
      "block": "07",
      "text": "The ledger proves.",
      "start": 165.876,
      "end": 167.368
    },
    {
      "block": "07",
      "text": "Close a case only when children learn more.",
      "start": 167.418,
      "end": 170.616
    }
  ]
}